    <text>
        <body>
        <div facs="#eSc_textblock_fa5427b3">
            <lb />
            <head><hi rendition="#b #i #in #larger">
                <persName corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/118986724">Paderewski</persName> WILL
                <lb /><hi rendition="#right">Play Again</hi>
            </hi></head>
            <ab><lb />
            <seg xml:id="topic_1" ana="#miracle" resp="#np" type="topic">
                Thanks to the wizardry of <name type="brand">Hardman Welte-
                <lb />Mignon(licensee) Reproducing Pianos</name>
            </seg>
            <seg xml:id="topic_2" ana="#immortality" resp="#np" type="topic">
                the
                <lb />art of <persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/118986724">Paderewski</persName> is imperishable
            </seg>.
            <seg xml:id="topic_3" ana="#repeatability" resp="#np" type="topic">
                He will
                <lb />play again, again and yet again for you -
                <lb />tonight, tomorrow night and other nights
            </seg>
            <lb />-
            <seg xml:id="topic_4" ana="#home" resp="#np" type="topic">
                in your own home.
            </seg>
            <lb /><persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/118986724">Paderewski</persName>,
            <persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/11918625X">Hofmann</persName>,
            <persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/116327642">Gabrilowitsch</persName>,
            <lb /><persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/11875081X">Saint-Saens</persName> and the most celebrated pianists
            <lb />have expressed their conceptions of the
            <lb />world's classics on the <name type="brand">Welte-Mignon</name>.
            <lb />
            <hi rendition="#c">
                Write for catalog.
                <lb />
                <seg xml:id="topic_5" ana="#affordability" resp="#np" type="topic"><hi rendition="#uc #b #smaller">Convenient Terms</hi></seg>

                <app>
                  <rdg source="#A">
                     <lb /><hi rendition="#b #in"><orgName>HARDMAN,PECK&amp;CO.</orgName></hi>
                     <lb /><hi rendition="#uc #b #smaller">Founded 1842</hi>
                  </rdg>
                  <rdg source="#B">
                     <hi rendition="#k">
                        <lb />Exclusive Representatives
                        <lb /><orgName>Schmoller &amp; Mueller</orgName>
                        <lb />Piano Co.
                        <address>
                           <lb /><addrLine>1514-16-18</addrLine>
                           <lb /><addrLine>Dodge St.</addrLine>
                           <lb /><addrLine>Phone</addrLine>
                           <lb /><addrLine>Douglas 1623</addrLine>
                        </address>
                     </hi>
                  </rdg>
                </app>
            </hi>
            <hi rendition="#c #b #larger">
            <lb />
            <address>
               <addrLine>433 Fifth Avenue, New York</addrLine>
               <lb /><addrLine>47-51 Flatbush Ave, Brooklyn</addrLine>
            </address>
            </hi>
            <hi rendition="#c #b #i">
                <lb />Represented in all Cities
            </hi></ab>
        
        </div>
        <div facs="#eSc_textblock_e9f6344e">
            <ab><lb /><orgName><hi rendition="#c #b"><hi rendition="#in #g2"><hi rendition="#in #larger"><hi rendition="#larger">HARDMAN</hi><lb />WELTE-MIGNON</hi></hi><lb /><hi rendition="#g2 #smaller">LICENSEE</hi></hi></orgName></ab>
        
        </div>
        <div facs="#eSc_textblock_eeb83339" type="illustration">
            <ab><seg xml:id="topic_6" ana="#phantom_body" resp="#np" type="topic">
                <figure>
                    <desc>
                        In the background: newspapers with headlines such as
                        "Paderewski here, will play no more", "Paderewski says
                        his piano playing […] at an en[d]", "Paderewski puts
                        poland above piano". In the foreground: the half-transparent 
                        figure of Paderewski playing the piano.
                    </desc>
                </figure>
            </seg></ab>
        </div>
